 * The prepare-time fee quote. Amounts are USDC base-unit decimal strings
 * (JSON-number-loss-free); the owner signs `(fee_receiver, max_fee)` into the
 * op's canonical message and the guard CPIs `transfer_checked(actual_fee)` to
 * `fee_receiver`, enforcing `actual_fee <= max_fee <= cap` on chain.
 */
